    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> be the hyperbola, whose foci are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and eccentricity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>. Then the length of its latus rectum is:",
