  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given the foci points of a hyperbola are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ae</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mtext>given</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;the latus&nbsp;rectum of a hyperbola is given by,</p><p>L.R. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>L.R.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
